        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十八日傍晚，东京五百赛第二轮，伊埃拉对阵吉布森。首盘三比五落后，她回破追到四比五，却再次丢掉发球局。盘末这一分，更让人意外。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f900ce9a945d9712267038915ea90178d3113d1fca0c12c5397b7fb3b3e5c5e9",
      "words_sha256": "2ecbbd0b3b64cc7cd5cfbafb5dce1583a6bd8d2b316eeae4248cdb0217858318"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2542dd458de080512a4b1e6bc791f7d664153df380e67948ec73352a99031015",
      "request_id": "2542dd458de080512a4b1e6bc791f7d664153df380e67948ec73352a99031015",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e050f6c385d5f3f264b3c2f924718823",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先丢一盘，伊埃拉却连赢了最后九局。四比六、六比二、六比零。她在东京逆转吉布森，晋级八强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e6d589e855d4289d482a8299ad72d3b905c03d8ec55c4d3fb496798456bc6506",
      "words_sha256": "3748053cb90c19ef725818a092bb3182bc4237be1e4f738ffcc48e8af857d88d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6bbdb1c637aa406e7b942f6f035809b98db1e0b6437239b754b759d98919415f",
      "request_id": "6bbdb1c637aa406e7b942f6f035809b98db1e0b6437239b754b759d98919415f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fa084dd38adafc7588634215583dab88",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "丢掉首盘后，伊埃拉先破发，再稳住自己的发球局。吉布森一发进球后的得分率，从首盘百分之七十八，降到第二盘百分之六十。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d97df3a3fe51343d4023b4c5336bf0dce854548fe3466d0e122b688985efcdf5",
      "words_sha256": "d683cb1d10fa18147121e4f8e9c4d205c62e8656e856278704fb2a710d61f5f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:702277a46ab9d03cf5b6c2b32214c3d6e857a1f5e0c8a5cb04080431cc7d7fb6",
      "request_id": "702277a46ab9d03cf5b6c2b32214c3d6e857a1f5e0c8a5cb04080431cc7d7fb6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d686960f46c9fbbbacc06c40f0ce9ed",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从盘末的无奈，到赛后的挥手致意，这场逆转，伊埃拉没有把遗憾留到最后。下一轮，她还能继续向前吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ece2428d3602027bd790c66b0aaf9cd7e977511494e443c3bdb7d2769ccb1b88",
      "words_sha256": "4f1fb02c5078054f7edf63e1c7de9830b1c913a73337bd6a273e7c8a56a5f2e2"
    },
    {
